  How you'll open your Apps
  Choose how phones, TVs and laptops will open your Apps. Home network needs nothing to set up.
  You can change this later in Settings, under Access.

    ● Home network (default)
  > ○ Easy names at home · coming soon
    ○ From anywhere, privately · coming soon
    ○ Your own web address · coming soon
    ○ Bring your own

  Easy names will let you open each App with a short name like movies.local instead of numbers. A
  small web server on this computer, Caddy, will answer to the names. They will work only on your
  home network. It isn't available yet: your Apps stay on your network.

